+	 * where the radio ends up in a state a register-level reset can't
+	 * clear -- observed on some units as a beacon-miss/bb-hang cycle
+	 * that keeps recurring every time it reassociates -- only an actual
+	 * power-off/power-on cycle (the same effect a hardware kill switch
